==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|na|lang=ru}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|h₂neh₃|lang=ru}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-на.ogg|Audio}}

===Preposition===
'''на''' (na)

'''accusative case''' ''(movement towards)'':

# [[onto]], [[on]]
#:* на [[стол#Russian|стол]] — ''onto the table''
# [[to]], [[toward]]
#:* {{Cyrl|на [[почта#Russian|по́чту]]}} — ''to the post office''
# [[into]], [[in]]
# ''(duration, value, purpose)'' [[for]]
#:* на [[что#Russian|что]]? — ''what for?''

'''prepositional case''' ''(position on)'':
# [[on]], [[upon]]
#:* {{Cyrl|на [[стол#Russian|столе́]]}} — ''on the table''
# [[in]], [[at]]
#:* {{Cyrl|на [[почта#Russian|по́чте]]}} — ''at the post office''
# [[with]], [[for]]

===Particle===
'''на''' (na)

# [[here]]! (said when giving someone something)

